 ## Meaning and limits
 
-The order is evidence that a testing safeguard was written into this transfer. It is contrary evidence to an assumption that distribution necessarily removed every testing right. It is **not** a right for any member of the public, proof that a party tested the piece, or a finding about current enforceability. We have not verified a direct court-file original, later amendments, compliance or present condition. The current docket portal’s2021metadata label is not treated as the date of this2009order.
